WEBVTT

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:01.083
but the very sight of our own dead.

00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.059
Forbidden.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.476
Shall we take a test?

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.393
Can you take the fingers
of your right hand?

00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:11.934
Yeah, you, everyone,

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:17.059
and count off the number of corpses
that you have seen, touched,

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:20.250
kissed and embraced in your entire life?

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:22.518
One?

00:03:22.542 --> 00:03:24.059
Or two?

00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:25.333
Or none?

00:03:26.042 --> 00:03:30.809
Will your corpse count make it
to the fingers of your left hand?